<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-24T22:36:59.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:36:59 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli fire killed a disabled Syrian man in the Daraa buffer zone and deployed rooftop snipers in southern Syria, while Israeli forces detained three people in Quneitra. Syrian security officers were killed in a raid on an ISIL cell near Damascus, and clashes continued in Rankous and the Damascus countryside. Protest rallies across Syria denounced repeated Israeli incursions, and the road linking Damascus and Suwayda was blocked amid demands for detainees' release, with outlaw groups closing the Sweida-Damascus highway. Arms depot explosions in Syria left 37 dead. 2732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNRzFxMmE4dWx3blk3Yy1MSGJTOXI4NC1URUM3OFBTdzdKUGRWWWRLLXl2bXJfNmoxLXJ6dmN3RFdmU0pRanZsN3dMXzZWaDRpbFhhdm1wanFDQ2FkdUxGcFoyaW41MjkwMER1RDVfRF9MLTgxcTlCMl9tTGgzOFNWV2NublFLUkM2VjBDU3A5Wm9SdVZfeEFyQlRjc09yc0pocTF1emZPMlJ2dVUzRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFByX3hUSmJucGdmRFU0SlB0QVMxRElTeVotWVJKTGNUcEMwbHZHMzZobklOTTdBVGtiT2s1Z1BCOUtRRDJpbEFEMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQZkdZS3h4YjlQZnJmVU1tWlhscFA3MHhyZzlvcmxwellWT2VsWVpCR2l2eDNmcm9UdGJTRzJiMDlmdHBYbnZEcnZyOUFlVjdFaldDSkJpYmdEcTFHbU5WV01JcG00UW5UUlV4ZHhKTV9ZVWFITFFRZnJDdlNOVWdGY1p6VUZHZno4U0R1MUlqYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPTmRkWmpfdGtZeGhnNkl3cnA5X1VMUnlJR3NMbVFGTWtQc2RJQ24wNUFFU3NFbWppczJKUEdoQUFkR1ZBeGotelFmMUJPNndveENhMGhaZFVOcFJucjJMeHQzaDhyLVlQUlNvOVUtbGZDNnhfRFp4cWdWZ21xVHJVRnFtTnlmZWEtQzVIOEE0SjFaV1h3MmZweTBuc1Z1UEh0S3BvTWdDZF9EdktwbnNWcjJSS1ZuM2JS?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Arab Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.